  "remarks": "TAi.043 Title: Qari. Designation: a) Minister of Planning under the Taliban regime (1996-2001) b) Minister of Higher Education under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Passport no: Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009731, issued on 13 Oct. 2021 in Kabul, Afghanistan (Name in Latin script: Iadenamohammad Nazri Mohammad; expires on 13 Oct. 2026) b) OA 454044, issued in Afghanistan. Member of Taliban Supreme Council responsible for Takhar and Badakhshan provinces. Height 172cm.; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended 3 Sep 2003, 9 July 2007, 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov 2011, 25 Oct 2012, 7 Sep. 2016, 10 Mar. 2026)",
